<title>UK: Croda names Richmond new finance director.</title>
<headline>Croda names Richmond new finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British holding company Croda International Plc said on Friday its finance director, Richard Heseltine, would leave the company and be succeeded by Barbara Richmond, finance director of Whessoe Plc.</p>
<p>Separately, Whessoe said it named its financial controller, Chris Lawrence, as its new finance director, effective from February 3.</p>
</text>
